WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.680
Wear the PPE required for the task and check that high-visibility
clothing is visible. Follow the site's water, shade and rest
arrangements in hot weather.

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:20.920
Report reduced visibility or changes in the road surface and
follow the site's procedure for restricting movement. Keep the
emergency route available.

